{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>「牛坑腩×牛板腱」雙重升級</h2>\n<p>愛吃越南菜的你，一定知道胡志明必吃、平民米芝蓮的錦麗！越南過江龍錦麗 @pholehk 近期將招牌湯粉全面升級，配上堅持手作的經典小食與慢活滴漏咖啡！一碗正宗的越南牛骨湯粉，靈魂在於湯底與牛肉的極完美配搭，「錦麗生熟牛肉粉」（$82）再度升級，一次過帶來「牛坑腩×牛板腱」的雙重口感！每日現場慢火炆煮的牛坑腩，完美鎖住牛腩的鮮味與肉汁，並充分吸收濃郁湯底精華，入口爽滑入味、牛味十足；配搭嚴選的嫩滑牛板腱，大理石花紋般的油脂分佈均勻，肉香濃郁且口感細緻。\n</p>\n<h2>必吃香脆春卷+滴滴咖啡</h2>\n<p>錦麗堅持自家手工現包並做到「即點即炸」，力求還原最正宗的家庭手藝，推出令人難以抗拒的「手工現包越南春卷」（$45）。金黃酥脆的外皮，咬下去「咔嚓」作響，內餡卻依然保持香嫩多汁！越南美食最適合配搭一杯越南滴滴咖啡（$32），深烘焙的滴漏咖啡透過金屬濾壺緩緩滴落，與杯底奶香濃厚的煉乳慢慢交融。煉乳甜潤中和了咖啡豆特有的焦香苦澀，無論選擇熱飲或凍飲都能品嚐到那份香濃醇厚！</p>\n<h2>升級版火車頭粉</h2>\n<p>對牛肉粉專家而言，一碗集齊多重部位的「火車頭粉」（$92）簡直是「滋味大滿貫」！新版本特別加入優質牛坑腩和嫩滑牛板腱，一濃一嫩交織出雙重肉香。連同軟糯彈牙的牛筋、地道越式扎肉以及爽口彈牙的自家製牛丸，五款配料在清甜牛骨湯中，每一口都是層次豐富的味道！若想轉換口味，可以試試「越式蟹．肉餅蕃茄湯檬粉」（$78）。酸甜蕃茄湯底開胃又不膩口，主角以鮮味十足的越式蟹肉餅搭配厚實扎肉，吸滿蕃茄湯汁後更加美味！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552164304054596_3526964816b057c6b9e1dd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552164304054596_3526964816b057c6b9e1dd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955216455377689_15232530386b057c6ded2bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955216455377689_15232530386b057c6ded2bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552164722717567_3524657646b057c6fa1996.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552164722717567_3524657646b057c6fa1996.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552164898664330_15727413796b057c714f731.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552164898664330_15727413796b057c714f731.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552165085918635_18116725316b057c733897c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552165085918635_18116725316b057c733897c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955216526715121_12220414936b057c752aaf8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955216526715121_12220414936b057c752aaf8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552165446856466_8644528256b057c76ee8d3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552165446856466_8644528256b057c76ee8d3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552165707168812_14109714906b057c79bfcf1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552165707168812_14109714906b057c79bfcf1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgHsO7VE_fn/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T12:24:02.167594+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":818,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:00:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T14:17:33.484123+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T12:17:28.454051+00:00","content_hash":"b2a088b9eb17f42369f140b9045915898e2105abf89c9a4e0bd1ba957635ef44","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}